   "text": "• Canonical RDF / Knowledge Graph\n• Identity + Identifier Normalization\n• Evidence + Provenance\n• Policy-driven Validation\n• Semantic / Deterministic Matching\n• Pluggable Embedding Providers\n• Pluggable Projection Backends\n• Release Management\n• Durable Assertion / Artifact Store\n• Domain Packs\n• Extensive Automated Testing",
