   "text": "NORMALIZATION / IDENTITY\n\nDataNormalizer\nNormalizationPipeline\nIdentifierNormalizer\nLiteralNormalizer\nNormalizer\nnormalize_source_uri\n\nSource record  →  ParsedRecord\n        ↓\nDataNormalizer\n   ├─ Identifier\n   ├─ Literal\n   └─ URI / source",
