   "text": "RECONCILIATION / MATCHING\n\nCandidateMatch\nEnhancedCandidateMatch\nMeaningAligner\nMatchStrategyConfig\n\nHybrid matching:\nCandidate generation  →  Matching strategy\n   ├─ Lexical / Structural\n   └─ Semantic Embeddings\n        ↓\nEnhancedCandidateMatch\n        ↓\nMeaningAligner / Reconciliation",
