   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "END-TO-END RELEASE PIPELINE\nEndToEndReleasePipeline   release/pipeline.py\n\nCanonical flow:\nNormalize / Reconcile\n  ↓\nValidate\n  ↓\nResolve Provenance / Evidence\n  ↓\nBuild RDFDataset\n  ↓\nCreate Release\n  ↓\nBuild Projections\n  ↓\nPersist Assertions / Artifacts\n  ↓\nPublish Release / Status",
