   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ARCHITECTURE QUALITY VIEW",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el0346",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 12720,
   "width": 1280,
   "height": 560,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 3739974,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 38236234,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "el0347",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1759248000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "el0347",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 72,
   "y": 12728,
   "width": 1256,
   "height": 262.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 3747893,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 38340963,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1759248000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "QUALITY ASSESSMENT\n\nSeparation of concerns   4/5   Distinct normalization, validation, provenance, projection, release\nModularity               4/5   Provider / backend / store / domain-pack abstractions\nCohesion                 4/5   Strong functional grouping\nCoupling                 3/5   Identifier / pipeline / projection profile highly connected\nTestability              5/5   Many tests + memory implementations\nExtensibility            5/5   Pluggable providers, projections, domain packs\nScalability              3/5   Central release pipeline may serialize major work\nReliability              4/5   Durable stores, release states, rollback, migrations\nSecurity                 3/5   Security testing exists; auth / secrets unclear\nObservability            3/5   Logging, health, benchmarks present\nDeveloper experience     4/5   Extensive tests and abstractions\nOperational complexity   3/5   Multiple independently materialized projections",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el0346",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el0348",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 13340,
   "width": 1400,
   "height": 1180,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "dashed",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 55,
   "groupIds": [],
